            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A vaporization device includes biometric recognition systems. A vaporizer device is provided. The vaporizer device may include a vaporizer body comprising a cartridge receptacle, a heating element, a power source, and a sensor. The vaporizer device may further include a vaporizer cartridge that is selectively coupled to the vaporizer body, the vaporizer cartridge comprising one or more translucent surfaces and a passageway between the sensor and the one or more translucent surfaces. The vaporizer device may further include a controller configured to determine, based on data from the sensor, whether a user is authorized to use the vaporizer device. The controller further configured to provide power to the heating element to generate an aerosol responsive to determining the authorization of the user. Related methods and articles of manufacture are also described.</p>
